{%- comment -%}
  chaos_unleashed_master.liquid
  Version:      1.2.0
  Last updated: 2026-08-21

  Purpose:
    Orchestrates independent performance modules in a stable load order.

  Judge.me policy:
    Homepage and collection pages use the intent-driven Judge.me deferrer so
    review JavaScript does not consume the no-interaction critical window.
    Product pages and all other surfaces retain the existing third-party
    deferrer, preserving fast PDP review availability.

  !! NOT INCLUDED — chaos_unleashed_cfh_defer !!
    cfh_defer requires the Chaos_Raw_CFH variable captured in theme.liquid and
    must remain immediately after that capture.

  Load order:
    1. font_priority
    2. font_preload
    3. lcp_preload
    4. performance_deferrer
    5. third-party/Judge.me deferrer (template-aware)
    6. hitbox compatibility module
    7. hero_video_defer
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_font_priority' -%}
{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_font_preload' -%}
{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_lcp_preload' -%}
{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_performance_deferrer' -%}

{%- if request.page_type == 'index' or request.page_type == 'collection' -%}
  {%- render 'lb-judgeme-intent-defer' -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- render 'chaos_unleashed_third_party_defer' -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_hitbox_suspend' -%}
{%- render 'chaos_unleashed_hero_video_defer' -%}
